The [[Platinum Customer Card]] is an [[accessory]] obtainable by combining two [[Customer Card]]s. It has a number of (mainly shop-related) effects. It increases [[Treasure]] frequency in the shop and allows the player to collect an additional one. It also gives a chance of [[Trade]] offer. Relatively rare items placed near its corners will each cause 2 debuff reflections.

The [[Uniquely Unique]] skill scales with [[Customer Card]] and [[Platinum Customer Card]], along with any other Uniques.
